        "content": "## DryRun meetings API\nThe web app reads your meetings and briefs from the Meetings sheet: `GET /webhook/dryrun/meetings` and `GET /webhook/dryrun/meeting?id=` (docs/CONTRACT.md).",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 160
      },
